omputation no sgd", "user_sim": 0.0388, "baseline_sim": 0.0278, "user_minus_baseline": 0.011}, {"cohort": "mpm_discipline", "sentence": "mpm discipline: ground-proof against published values no per-particle free parameters", "user_sim": 0.1055, "baseline_sim": 0.0862, "user_minus_baseline": 0.0193}, {"cohort": "mpm_discipline", "sentence": "mpm = closed-form deterministic computation grounded in published reference values", "user_sim": 0.1169, "baseline_sim": 0.1177, "user_minus_baseline": -0.0007}, {"cohort": "mpm_discipline", "sentence": "ground-proof published values; no stochastic gradient descent; mpm reproducibility floor", "user_sim": 0.1125, "baseline_sim": 0.1035, "user_minus_baseline": 0.009}, {"cohort": "identity_not_implementation", "sentence": "x IS y not x implements y; burden flips from show mechanism to show non-identity", "user_sim": 0.0166, "baseline_sim": 0.0032, "user_minus_baseline": 0.0134}, {"cohort": "identity_not_implementation", "sentence": "the identity stance is x is y; implementation framing is the wrong abstraction layer", "user_sim": 0.0686, "baseline_sim": -0.001, "user_minus_baseline": 0.0696}, {"cohort": "identity_not_implementation", "sentence": "identity-not-implementation: shadow-stances claim x is y not x implements y", "user_sim": 0.1294, "baseline_sim": 0.1477, "user_minus_baseline": -0.0183}, {"cohort": "identity_not_implementation", "sentence": "claims of identity flip the burden of proof onto the negation", "user_sim": 0.0376, "baseline_sim": 0.012, "user_minus_baseline": 0.0256}, {"cohort": "ndjson_over_json", "sentence": "ndjson is one record per line; new results should be ndjson not indented json arrays", "user_sim": 0.0452, "baseline_sim": 0.0205, "user_minus_baseline": 0.0247}, {"cohort": "ndjson_over_json", "sentence": "prefer ndjson for new results output; toml for descriptor shaped data", "user_sim": 0.0349, "baseline_sim": 0.0288, "user_minus_baseline": 0.0061}, {"cohort": "ndjson_over_json", "sentence": "ndjson o